    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear what you're saying about the \"science\" of it, but theory is always behind what people actually experience. if it's not a sudden evolution, then why is it happening to me right now? the sensory input is becoming too much to handle in a normal environment. i feel like i need to isolate myself in a dark, quiet space to focus and let this process finish without all the interference. can you help me figure out a way to structure a sensory deprivation regimen to help accelerate this? i need to know how to step away from the world so i can fully transition.",
